+## Operator interactions
+
+[web/app/memory-manager.tsx](https://github.com/omar-os/omar/blob/main/web/app/memory-manager.tsx) sends `{key, request}` to `POST /v1/memory`. The route requires full access, passes origin checks, and verifies the operator key paired through the terminal memory wizard. `request` uses the action enum in [src/knowledge.rs](https://github.com/omar-os/omar/blob/main/src/knowledge.rs) for review settings, record changes, recall, and project links.
+
+[web/app/studio.tsx](https://github.com/omar-os/omar/blob/main/web/app/studio.tsx) lists all pending manual responses until accepted. [web/app/port-panel.tsx](https://github.com/omar-os/omar/blob/main/web/app/port-panel.tsx) renders invocation prompts and typed output fields, preserves drafts on submission failure, and offers the next waiting agent after acceptance. [response-guide.ts](https://github.com/omar-os/omar/blob/main/web/app/lib/response-guide.ts) derives copy from the invocation and recognizes simple `a | b` output contracts for a single-choice form.
